_pipeline_spec_three_roles_abc", "label": "Three Independent Critique Roles A/B/C", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "brain/knowledge/02_prj93_pipeline_spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Three independent calls plus a synthesiser; never one call producing three voices."}, {"id": "brain_knowledge_02_prj93_pipeline_spec_gate_list", "label": "Gate List G1-G9", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "brain/knowledge/02_prj93_pipeline_spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "brain_knowledge_02_prj93_pipeline_spec_g1_rmsse_vs_mase", "label": "G1 \u2014 RMSSE vs MASE as Headline Metric", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "brain/knowledge/02_prj93_pipeline_spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "MASE optimises the median, and Ellel's median day is \u00a30 on an 82%-zero series, so a near-zero flatline is rewarded."}, {"id": "brain_knowledge_02_prj93_pipeline_spec_g2_ellel_scale_basis", "label": "G2 \u2014 Ellel Scale Basis (unscaled or cost-weighted)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "brain/knowledge/02_prj93_pipeline_spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "brain_knowledge_02_prj93_pipeline_spec_g9_overleaf_push", "label": "G9 \u2014 Every Overleaf Push, Unconditional", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "brain/knowledge/02_prj93_pipeline_spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "brain_knowledge_02_prj93_pipeline_spec_phase_order", "label": "Phase Order A-F", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "brain/knowledge/02_prj93_pipeline_spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A and B run in parallel because B's decisions are prerequisites for E, and serialising them behind A wastes the only slack in the schedule."}, {"id": "brain_knowledge_02_prj93_pipeline_spec_dependency_conflicts", "label": "Dependency Conflicts (the stated order inverted for three items)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "brain/knowledge/02_prj93_pipeline_spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Literature review settles before methodology, methodology before any rerun. The second half holds without exception; the first half is inverted for three specific items, recorded rather than quietly reordered."}, {"id": "brain_knowledge_02_prj93_pipeline_spec_iterative_refine_dropped", "label": "ITERATIVE_REFINE Dropped Deliberately", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "brain/knowledge/02_prj93_pipeline_spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Refit-until-better is p-hacking with a progress bar on a dissertation; an iterate-until-improved loop would retroactively invalidate the pre-registration-by-commit-ordering discipline. A disappointing result is reported as a negative in stage 15 instead."}, {"id": "brain_knowledge_02_prj93_pipeline_spec_prereg_by_commit_ordering", "label": "Pre-registration by Commit Ordering", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "brain/knowledge/02_prj93_pipeline_spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Described as the project's single strongest asset and explicitly not suspended for the remaining work."}, {"id": "brain_knowledge_02_prj93_pipeline_spec_what_this_spec_does_not_settle", "label": "What the Spec Does Not Settle", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "brain/knowledge/02_prj93_pipeline_spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured